Package: SummarizedHeatmap
Title: Heatmaps for SummarizedExperiment Objects
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R:
    person("Bradley", "Blaser", email = "bradley.blaser@osumc.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3168-5423"))
Description: Represents a heatmap as a SummarizedExperiment-derived object,
    holding a single assay together with its row and column annotations and
    any hierarchical clustering. Assay values, annotations, display order,
    and dendrograms stay synchronized as the object is subsetted or
    reclustered, so a heatmap's components cannot drift out of step with
    each other. Each visual component (the main heatmap, annotation strips,
    dendrograms) is returned as an ordinary ggplot2 plot, and these can be
    composed, laid out, and customized using patchwork.
